{
  "_comment": "Cell coordinates are in pixels of the source image. Tune by opening the sheet, reading pixel coords of each labeled cell, and updating x/y/w/h. The current values are placeholders for the 8-pose Lionn sheet (assumes a ~1456x1024 image with 2 rows of 4 cells under a header banner). Run with --noBgRemove first to verify cropping, then re-run without that flag.",
